2122
00:02:46,017 --> 00:02:49,937
meditation    summoning

2123
00:03:19,057 --> 00:03:20,767
We may have to clear out of here.

2124
00:03:22,477 --> 00:03:24,017
Over here, over here.

2125
00:03:25,767 --> 00:03:26,807
Mom.

2126
00:03:26,807 --> 00:03:28,147
Timothy.

2127
00:03:28,147 --> 00:03:29,687
Where've you been?

2128
00:03:30,227 --> 00:03:30,857
C'mon.

2129
00:03:30,857 --> 00:03:31,737
Let's go.

2130
00:03:34,197 --> 00:03:36,867
There've been more surveillance units.

2131
00:03:36,867 --> 00:03:37,907
That's right,

2132
00:03:37,907 --> 00:03:39,787
after <i>someone</i> came here...

2133
00:03:40,537 --> 00:03:42,577
What are you gonna do?

2134
00:03:42,577 --> 00:03:44,537
Why don't you go somewhere else?

2135
00:03:46,537 --> 00:03:49,377
Why'd you come here in the first place?

2136
00:03:49,667 --> 00:03:51,047
That's...

2137
00:03:52,007 --> 00:03:55,127
Of course it's because he's the Chosen One.

2138
00:03:59,757 --> 00:04:03,517
This man is a famous revolutionary in Romdeau.

2139
00:04:03,977 --> 00:04:07,057
He took the dome's system head-on

2140
00:04:07,057 --> 00:04:09,397
and directed the resistance's activities.

2141
00:04:09,397 --> 00:04:10,517
He is a warrior.

2142
00:04:10,517 --> 00:04:12,647
H-Hey, Mr. Hoody,

2143
00:04:12,647 --> 00:04:13,397
wait a minute-

2144
00:04:13,397 --> 00:04:15,647
You saw his brilliant marksmanship, didn't you?

2145
00:04:16,197 --> 00:04:20,657
Even if a whole army of surveillance units were to come,

2146
00:04:20,657 --> 00:04:23,037
it'd be child's play to him.

2147
00:04:23,037 --> 00:04:25,917
Wow...

2148
00:04:26,247 --> 00:04:28,877
Romdeau is near collapse;

2149
00:04:29,417 --> 00:04:32,917
citizens are all turning into
 refugees and heading for the Commune.

2150
00:04:32,917 --> 00:04:37,127
Who would have thought that the city's last
 resort would be to launch a series of attacks on us.

2151
00:04:37,717 --> 00:04:41,927
Officials are struggling to prevent the increase in deviants, but...

2152
00:04:43,807 --> 00:04:46,307
Sadly, they don't realize that

2153
00:04:46,307 --> 00:04:49,437
it only enflames Vincent, the revolutionary warrior's, will to fight.

2154
00:04:49,437 --> 00:04:51,057
What fools.

2155
00:04:51,057 --> 00:04:52,437
Mr. Hoody...

2156
00:04:52,437 --> 00:04:54,397
"Revolutionary warrior"?

2157
00:04:56,107 --> 00:04:59,697
As if I give a rat's ass about what's happening in Romdeau.

2158
00:04:59,697 --> 00:05:01,067
I don't want to get dragged into this mess.

2159
00:05:01,067 --> 00:05:02,577
What are you saying?

2160
00:05:02,577 --> 00:05:05,577
This is a revolution in which our
 freedom and dignity are at stake-

2161
00:05:05,577 --> 00:05:07,037
If we get killed,

2162
00:05:07,037 --> 00:05:08,577
freedom doesn't mean shit.

2163
00:05:08,577 --> 00:05:09,917
She's right.

2164
00:05:09,917 --> 00:05:11,077
If we get killed-

2165
00:05:11,077 --> 00:05:14,587
There won't be any more victims.

2166
00:05:14,587 --> 00:05:16,337
How can you be so sure?

2167
00:05:18,087 --> 00:05:19,507
Because...

2168
00:05:20,297 --> 00:05:21,717
Ah, yes.

2169
00:05:21,717 --> 00:05:23,427
It's because a certain source

2170
00:05:23,427 --> 00:05:28,057
has informed me of where the surveillance units will attack.

2171
00:05:30,937 --> 00:05:34,357
I kept this a secret from everyone to prevent confusion,

2172
00:05:34,357 --> 00:05:39,487
but I'm currently in negotiations with Romdeau
 authorities regarding the Commune's autonomy.

2173
00:05:39,487 --> 00:05:41,737
The enemy is desperate.

2174
00:05:42,237 --> 00:05:46,157
They even begged us to return to Romdeau.

2175
00:05:46,617 --> 00:05:47,867
Seriously?

2176
00:05:47,867 --> 00:05:49,247
Sounds like a dream.

2177
00:05:55,747 --> 00:05:57,627
You barely escaped with your life.

2178
00:05:59,757 --> 00:06:02,087
If I hadn't saved you,

2179
00:06:02,087 --> 00:06:04,677
you would've been beaten.

2180
00:06:05,007 --> 00:06:06,177
But...

2181
00:06:06,177 --> 00:06:08,097
I don't know about lying to them...

2182
00:06:08,427 --> 00:06:11,187
You escaped unscathed because I thought quickly on my feet,

2183
00:06:11,187 --> 00:06:13,347
but it was a close call.

2184
00:06:13,347 --> 00:06:15,057
Extremely close.

2185
00:06:21,567 --> 00:06:24,947
We can just let Hoody handle this.

2186
00:06:26,577 --> 00:06:28,157
What, Quinn?

2187
00:06:28,157 --> 00:06:30,537
Are you gonna pick another fight?

2188
00:06:30,827 --> 00:06:32,167
Not really.

2189
00:06:32,167 --> 00:06:36,207
I'm just wondering how Hoody's making contact with Romdeau,

2190
00:06:36,707 --> 00:06:38,297
that's all.

2191
00:06:52,057 --> 00:06:54,307
Ah, this is the Commune.

2192
00:06:54,647 --> 00:06:55,937
Calling Romdeau.

2193
00:06:56,727 --> 00:06:57,817
Over.

2194
00:06:58,687 --> 00:06:59,727
What's the matter?

2195
00:07:00,227 --> 00:07:01,897
Quinn said...

2196
00:07:02,647 --> 00:07:03,737
What?

2197
00:07:04,777 --> 00:07:05,907
All right.

2198
00:07:07,947 --> 00:07:11,827
Seems they don't care about appearances anymore.

2199
00:07:13,037 --> 00:07:15,747
They're insisting that I change sides.

2200
00:07:15,747 --> 00:07:17,997
They're desperate, I tell you.

2201
00:07:18,917 --> 00:07:21,207
Someone from Romdeau is coming here?

2202
00:07:21,207 --> 00:07:21,917
Who?

2203
00:07:21,917 --> 00:07:23,257
A negotiator?

2204
00:07:23,917 --> 00:07:25,887
A negotiator would be-

2205
00:07:25,887 --> 00:07:26,797
Maybe...

2206
00:07:26,797 --> 00:07:28,677
they're coming to welcome us?

2207
00:07:29,137 --> 00:07:30,257
W-Well...

2208
00:07:30,257 --> 00:07:32,637
I suppose that's a possibility.

2209
00:07:32,637 --> 00:07:34,477
We can go back to Romdeau!

2210
00:07:34,477 --> 00:07:35,597
Lucky us!

2211
00:07:35,597 --> 00:07:36,647
All right!

2212
00:07:38,647 --> 00:07:41,397
Hey, is that what they call a radio?

2213
00:07:50,987 --> 00:07:52,617
Worrying was a waste of time.

2214
00:07:52,617 --> 00:07:53,997
See, I told you.

2215
00:07:53,997 --> 00:07:56,367
We even have a revolutionary warrior.

2216
00:07:56,367 --> 00:07:57,827
We're invincible.

2217
00:07:58,997 --> 00:08:00,417
Uh...

2218
00:08:00,417 --> 00:08:01,917
Where's that warrior, anyway?

2219
00:08:10,427 --> 00:08:11,637
Found you!

2220
00:08:11,927 --> 00:08:13,387
You're playing hide-and-seek, right?

2221
00:08:13,387 --> 00:08:14,637
Me too!

2222
00:08:17,937 --> 00:08:19,937
Go away!

2223
00:08:21,227 --> 00:08:22,687
Roger!

2224
00:08:22,687 --> 00:08:25,527
Hide-and-seek, hide-and-seek!

2225
00:08:30,487 --> 00:08:32,027
Don't think he'd be here.

2226
00:08:32,027 --> 00:08:33,117
Yeah.

2227
00:08:48,717 --> 00:08:49,837
Done!

2228
00:08:49,837 --> 00:08:51,137
Me too!

2229
00:08:52,427 --> 00:08:54,347
Don't be a copycat!

2230
00:09:01,647 --> 00:09:05,527
What do you think you can accomplish
 with that gloomy face, revolutionary warrior?

2231
00:09:05,527 --> 00:09:07,027
Sorry...

2232
00:09:07,937 --> 00:09:09,277
Actually, this is all your-

2233
00:09:09,277 --> 00:09:11,657
Are you just like them?

2234
00:09:12,277 --> 00:09:16,287
Hanging on to me, yet independent enough to complain?

2235
00:09:17,827 --> 00:09:20,787
I'm the only one who thinks about the Commune's welfare.

2236
00:09:21,207 --> 00:09:22,627
Don't worry.

2237
00:09:22,627 --> 00:09:25,627
As long as we get through this, there will be peace.

2238
00:09:26,047 --> 00:09:27,087
Worst case,

2239
00:09:27,087 --> 00:09:31,297
<u>Note:</u> Centzon Totochtin, from Aztec mythology, are the four hundred divine
               rabbits of the Aztec pantheon who preside over parties and drunkenness.

2240
00:09:27,087 --> 00:09:29,667
we'll escape with the Centzon Totochtin.

2241
00:09:29,667 --> 00:09:31,297
"Centzon"...?

2242
00:09:31,297 --> 00:09:33,547
Four hundred rabbits.

2243
00:09:34,007 --> 00:09:35,257
Rabbits?

2244
00:09:38,347 --> 00:09:39,887
Found a rabbit!

2245
00:09:39,887 --> 00:09:40,557
Oh, hey-

2246
00:09:41,517 --> 00:09:42,517
Hop!

2247
00:09:42,517 --> 00:09:43,897
Wait.

2248
00:09:43,897 --> 00:09:44,937
Hop!

2249
00:09:51,897 --> 00:09:55,157
Well, only Hoody's seen it.

2250
00:09:55,657 --> 00:09:58,657
I have no idea what kind of vehicle it is.

2251
00:09:58,657 --> 00:10:00,707
"Four hundred rabbits"...

2252
00:10:00,707 --> 00:10:02,327
What a joke of a name.

2253
00:10:02,707 --> 00:10:04,327
Who knows where he hid it.

2254
00:10:04,327 --> 00:10:06,337
Why did he hide it?

2255
00:10:06,667 --> 00:10:09,587
He said something about the outside being dangerous,

2256
00:10:10,087 --> 00:10:12,337
but he just wants to keep everyone here.

2257
00:10:12,837 --> 00:10:14,547
He wants to take us down with him.

2258
00:10:15,217 --> 00:10:16,887
I'm scared

2259
00:10:16,887 --> 00:10:18,347
that lies will lead to more lies

2260
00:10:18,887 --> 00:10:23,347
and one day, something terrible will happen.

2261
00:10:23,687 --> 00:10:26,977
People are pitiful, aren't they?

2262
00:10:26,977 --> 00:10:28,567
Every single one of them.

2263
00:10:32,187 --> 00:10:34,357
When was the negotiator coming again?

2264
00:10:34,357 --> 00:10:35,857
Soon.

2265
00:10:35,857 --> 00:10:37,237
From where?

2266
00:10:37,237 --> 00:10:38,737
Probably...

2267
00:10:38,737 --> 00:10:40,447
from over there.

2268
00:10:40,447 --> 00:10:43,787
I think he might pretend to come from over there,

2269
00:10:43,787 --> 00:10:47,457
then come swooshing in from over that way.

2270
00:11:48,767 --> 00:11:50,307
Hoody, he's here!

2271
00:11:50,307 --> 00:11:51,057
He's here!

2272
00:11:51,057 --> 00:11:52,477
Who?

2273
00:11:53,397 --> 00:11:54,477
This way, please.

2274
00:12:00,947 --> 00:12:02,487
The negotiator.

2275
00:12:26,097 --> 00:12:27,977
I can't hear them at all.

2276
00:12:27,977 --> 00:12:29,437
What are they talking about?

2277
00:12:30,017 --> 00:12:32,437
Can't see the negotiator's face, either.

2278
00:12:32,727 --> 00:12:35,567
Think Hoody can cut us a good deal?

2279
00:12:45,867 --> 00:12:49,077
You don't seem to be the same negotiator as before.

2280
00:12:49,077 --> 00:12:52,377
Would you tell us your name at least?

2281
00:12:55,207 --> 00:12:57,207
This is going nowhere.

2282
00:12:57,207 --> 00:13:00,007
What did you come here for?

2283
00:13:02,087 --> 00:13:04,547
Did you get too scared to continue negotiations?

2284
00:13:05,097 --> 00:13:06,507
Are you going to use force?

2285
00:13:06,927 --> 00:13:08,927
He'll take you on then.

2286
00:13:10,017 --> 00:13:12,187
U-Um...

2287
00:13:12,807 --> 00:13:13,977
It's me,

2288
00:13:13,977 --> 00:13:15,147
Vincent.

2289
00:13:16,437 --> 00:13:17,527
Re-l...

2290
00:13:18,027 --> 00:13:19,147
Mayer.

2291
00:13:19,817 --> 00:13:21,697
I've come to take you back.

2292
00:13:21,697 --> 00:13:22,407
What?

2293
00:13:23,067 --> 00:13:24,527
What is this about?

2294
00:13:24,527 --> 00:13:26,407
You're coming back to Romdeau.

2295
00:13:26,697 --> 00:13:28,537
As if I could do that...

2296
00:13:29,197 --> 00:13:30,697
on such short notice...

2297
00:13:30,697 --> 00:13:31,907
What's going on?

2298
00:13:31,907 --> 00:13:35,417
Once you deviate from Romdeau, you can never go back.

2299
00:13:35,827 --> 00:13:36,837
Why?

2300
00:13:36,837 --> 00:13:38,587
Why this man?

2301
00:13:40,547 --> 00:13:41,507
Be quiet!

2302
00:13:41,967 --> 00:13:43,427
Go over there!

2303
00:13:45,137 --> 00:13:46,547
Okay!

2304
00:13:46,547 --> 00:13:48,347
Vincent, we're going back.

2305
00:13:48,347 --> 00:13:49,347
Wait!

2306
00:13:49,347 --> 00:13:51,097
I won't let you take Vincent!

2307
00:13:51,517 --> 00:13:52,807
Do you want to get yourself killed?

2308
00:13:55,307 --> 00:13:56,607
Re-l, it's me.

2309
00:13:56,607 --> 00:13:57,607
Can you hear me?

2310
00:13:58,687 --> 00:13:59,477
Chief,

2311
00:13:59,777 --> 00:14:01,987
we have a report from the Security Bureau-

2312
00:14:01,987 --> 00:14:02,737
Re-l.

2313
00:14:03,987 --> 00:14:04,697
What?

2314
00:14:04,697 --> 00:14:05,487
Get out of the way.

2315
00:14:06,067 --> 00:14:07,197
What's going on?

2316
00:14:07,197 --> 00:14:09,277
There are humans all over the place outside.

2317
00:14:09,787 --> 00:14:10,697
Re-l...

2318
00:14:11,407 --> 00:14:14,747
I told you not to get in touch with outsiders...

2319
00:14:14,747 --> 00:14:16,997
They're right here in front of me.

2320
00:14:16,997 --> 00:14:18,167
I can't pretend they don't exist.

2321
00:14:18,167 --> 00:14:19,747
Why did you keep them a secret from me?

2322
00:14:20,247 --> 00:14:21,417
I...

2323
00:14:21,957 --> 00:14:24,337
didn't want to cause you unnecessary concern.

2324
00:14:24,337 --> 00:14:26,467
It's not just about PROXY anymore.

2325
00:14:27,047 --> 00:14:28,257
PROXY?

2326
00:14:28,797 --> 00:14:31,257
That's a dangerous topic.

2327
00:14:31,257 --> 00:14:32,767
Get away from him!

2328
00:14:34,477 --> 00:14:35,727
Dammit!

2329
00:14:36,557 --> 00:14:37,687
How...

2330
00:14:37,687 --> 00:14:39,187
do you know of that monster?

2331
00:14:39,817 --> 00:14:42,027
The PROXY, a monster?

2332
00:14:43,187 --> 00:14:45,697
You're a naÃ¯ve young lady.

2333
00:14:45,697 --> 00:14:47,067
He's laughing.

2334
00:14:47,067 --> 00:14:48,407
He totally has the upper hand.

2335
00:14:48,697 --> 00:14:53,287
They're called monsters and
 demons and such, but that's all hogwash.

2336
00:14:53,287 --> 00:14:55,907
PROXIES are magicians.

2337
00:14:55,907 --> 00:14:59,207
They can shapeshift into anything.

2338
00:14:59,707 --> 00:15:02,957
They can easily make themselves vanish.

2339
00:15:05,047 --> 00:15:09,137
They can sneak into the human mind and manipulate it at will.

2340
00:15:11,467 --> 00:15:15,347
They could produce lightning and incinerate this area in an instant.

2341
00:15:17,807 --> 00:15:21,267
They've called forth planets that spout flames too.

2342
00:15:23,317 --> 00:15:24,897
Will you be quiet?!

2343
00:15:29,987 --> 00:15:31,027
Get out!

2344
00:15:31,567 --> 00:15:33,657
Stay out until I say you can come back in!

2345
00:15:36,157 --> 00:15:38,707
Tag, tag!

2346
00:15:41,457 --> 00:15:43,037
Just between you and me,

2347
00:15:43,037 --> 00:15:45,757
there is more than one PROXY.

2348
00:15:46,297 --> 00:15:49,587
Once you set one foot outside, they're everywhere.

2349
00:15:49,587 --> 00:15:52,887
Just counting the ones I've seen with my own eyes...

2350
00:15:55,347 --> 00:15:56,387
Five?

2351
00:15:56,677 --> 00:15:57,927
Well...

2352
00:16:00,267 --> 00:16:01,937
This is a waste of time.

2353
00:16:01,937 --> 00:16:03,437
Let's go, Vincent.

2354
00:16:03,437 --> 00:16:04,437
Wait!

2355
00:16:05,357 --> 00:16:07,817
If you insist, I have no choice.

2356
00:16:07,817 --> 00:16:09,487
I can make a special exception

2357
00:16:09,947 --> 00:16:12,447
and tell you where PROXY is.

2358
00:16:13,987 --> 00:16:18,447
However, only if you'll accept our conditions.

2359
00:16:18,447 --> 00:16:19,707
Re-l, it's me.

2360
00:16:19,707 --> 00:16:20,497
Can you hear me?

2361
00:16:20,917 --> 00:16:21,917
What is it?

2362
00:16:23,207 --> 00:16:23,877
First,

2363
00:16:23,877 --> 00:16:25,747
accept our autonomy

2364
00:16:26,087 --> 00:16:27,547
The situation has changed.

2365
00:16:26,087 --> 00:16:28,667
and cease all hostilities immediately.

2366
00:16:27,547 --> 00:16:29,007
Come back ASAP.

2367
00:16:29,377 --> 00:16:31,717
I intend to do that anyway.

2368
00:16:31,717 --> 00:16:33,467
You're surprisingly obliging.

2369
00:16:32,887 --> 00:16:36,597
Second, establish friendly relations with us immediately,

2370
00:16:34,087 --> 00:16:36,137
Were you able to bring Vincent Law into your custody?

2371
00:16:36,597 --> 00:16:37,767
Of course.

2372
00:16:37,767 --> 00:16:40,267
and let those who wish to return to Romdeau-

2373
00:16:41,387 --> 00:16:42,517
Quiet!

2374
00:16:42,517 --> 00:16:43,767
Go over there!

2375
00:16:45,937 --> 00:16:47,897
But the surveillance units show up over there-

2376
00:16:48,227 --> 00:16:50,647
There are no surveillance units during negotiation!

2377
00:16:51,107 --> 00:16:52,147
All right.

2378
00:16:53,027 --> 00:16:54,407
We have to hurry, Vincent.

2379
00:16:57,277 --> 00:16:58,947
We don't have any more time.

2380
00:16:59,867 --> 00:17:03,117
The Security Bureau's preparing
 a sweep operation of the Commune.

2381
00:17:03,667 --> 00:17:05,537
If you stay here, you'll be killed too.

2382
00:17:06,787 --> 00:17:08,417
Sweep operation?

2383
00:17:08,417 --> 00:17:09,667
What do you mean?

2384
00:17:10,127 --> 00:17:12,297
You just agreed to establish friendly relations with us-

2385
00:17:12,667 --> 00:17:14,217
Come with me, Vincent.

2386
00:17:15,677 --> 00:17:17,427
Are soldiers coming here?

2387
00:17:17,717 --> 00:17:19,177
Are they going to mess things up?

2388
00:17:19,177 --> 00:17:20,717
What will happen to me?

2389
00:17:20,717 --> 00:17:22,057
What should I do?

2390
00:17:22,057 --> 00:17:23,057
Let go of me!

2391
00:17:23,557 --> 00:17:24,647
You...

2392
00:17:24,647 --> 00:17:26,307
Are you going to abandon us?

2393
00:17:27,017 --> 00:17:29,977
Are you going to run away even though we helped you?

2394
00:17:35,737 --> 00:17:36,567
Hey,

2395
00:17:36,987 --> 00:17:39,117
I said, don't be a copycat.

2396
00:17:41,747 --> 00:17:44,367
You should draw what you like, Pino.

2397
00:17:44,657 --> 00:17:46,497
What do I like to draw?

2398
00:17:46,497 --> 00:17:47,997
Don't ask me.

2399
00:17:47,997 --> 00:17:51,087
Just draw stuff that comes to mind,

2400
00:17:51,087 --> 00:17:53,797
like food you really want to eat now.

2401
00:17:53,797 --> 00:17:55,257
I don't eat food.

2402
00:17:55,257 --> 00:17:57,177
Oh, right.

2403
00:17:57,177 --> 00:17:58,927
Then try closing your eyes.

2404
00:18:00,557 --> 00:18:03,307
Remember stuff that was fun.

2405
00:18:06,557 --> 00:18:08,357
If you remember something,

2406
00:18:08,357 --> 00:18:09,897
all you have to do is draw that.

2407
00:18:17,777 --> 00:18:19,697
Guess we're gonna go back.

2408
00:18:19,697 --> 00:18:21,617
We have to pack.

2409
00:18:22,697 --> 00:18:23,867
Huh?

2410
00:18:24,407 --> 00:18:25,537
Surveillance units.

2411
00:18:25,537 --> 00:18:27,167
I thought they weren't gonna come anymore.

2412
00:18:27,167 --> 00:18:28,787
Maybe they came to get us.

2413
00:18:39,757 --> 00:18:41,387
We're going, Vincent.

2414
00:18:43,007 --> 00:18:44,427
U-Um...

2415
00:18:47,057 --> 00:18:51,057
Couldn't we take the others with us?

2416
00:18:52,687 --> 00:18:55,357
Um, I just can't go back by myself.

2417
00:18:55,937 --> 00:18:57,067
Well...

2418
00:18:57,527 --> 00:19:01,027
Once you're back in Romdeau,
 you'll forget about them soon enough-

2419
00:19:01,617 --> 00:19:03,987
about the Commune and everything else.

2420
00:19:04,537 --> 00:19:06,697
You'll just go back to the life you had before.

2421
00:19:07,157 --> 00:19:08,457
Would everything

2422
00:19:08,457 --> 00:19:10,577
really go back the way it was?

2423
00:19:10,577 --> 00:19:12,337
Don't worry.

2424
00:19:12,337 --> 00:19:14,957
I'll prove your innocence.

2425
00:19:14,957 --> 00:19:16,207
That's not it!

2426
00:19:18,837 --> 00:19:19,967
I mean...

2427
00:19:21,757 --> 00:19:23,507
I've found out

2428
00:19:23,967 --> 00:19:26,057
that there is a world outside.

2429
00:19:26,807 --> 00:19:29,977
Even if I go back to Romdeau now...

2430
00:19:32,267 --> 00:19:33,727
I can't become a model citizen.

2431
00:19:34,147 --> 00:19:37,107
Romdeau is the only place to return to.

2432
00:19:37,107 --> 00:19:38,237
Where else will you go?

2433
00:19:38,687 --> 00:19:40,107
This trash heap?

2434
00:19:40,107 --> 00:19:41,237
Don't make me laugh.

2435
00:19:42,817 --> 00:19:44,327
You're right.

2436
00:19:44,327 --> 00:19:46,737
I wonder where I should go.

2437
00:19:46,737 --> 00:19:48,537
Neither here nor Romdeau are right.

2438
00:19:49,037 --> 00:19:51,917
I might as well go back to where I was born...

2439
00:19:52,577 --> 00:19:54,747
To that fallen dome?

2440
00:19:55,037 --> 00:19:56,087
Are you insane?

2441
00:19:56,917 --> 00:19:57,917
Watch out!

2442
00:20:10,227 --> 00:20:11,307
Stop it!

2443
00:21:02,027 --> 00:21:03,737
She's amazing.

2444
00:21:04,027 --> 00:21:06,107
She can do anything.

2445
00:21:17,787 --> 00:21:19,127
Timothy?

2446
00:21:24,297 --> 00:21:25,217
Re-l?

2447
00:21:25,797 --> 00:21:26,717
Re-l?

2448
00:21:27,717 --> 00:21:29,047
Daedalus...

2449
00:21:29,637 --> 00:21:31,507
The transmission got taken out.

2450
00:21:31,507 --> 00:21:33,057
I can't move like this.

2451
00:21:33,427 --> 00:21:34,267
Re-l...

2452
00:21:38,897 --> 00:21:39,977
Don't!

2453
00:21:39,977 --> 00:21:41,647
If you are exposed to the outside air, you'll-

2454
00:21:45,317 --> 00:21:45,987
Re-l!

2455
00:21:45,987 --> 00:21:46,987
Don't go!

2456
00:21:57,787 --> 00:21:59,497
<i>What are you?</i>

2457
00:22:12,137 --> 00:22:14,387
I need to make contact with Romdeau ASAP.

2458
00:22:14,677 --> 00:22:16,307
Is that a radio?

2459
00:22:16,847 --> 00:22:18,477
W-Well...

2460
00:22:25,027 --> 00:22:27,277
No, play a higher sound there.

2461
00:22:27,277 --> 00:22:28,567
What is this?!

2462
00:22:28,197 --> 00:22:29,447
I don't understand.

2463
00:22:28,567 --> 00:22:29,907
What's going on?!

2464
00:22:29,447 --> 00:22:29,907
Like this.

2465
00:22:31,777 --> 00:22:33,277
Get the radio out here.

2466
00:22:34,867 --> 00:22:36,537
Quinn, come with me.

2467
00:22:36,907 --> 00:22:38,207
What's the matter?

2468
00:22:38,207 --> 00:22:39,867
Hurry, hurry!

2469
00:22:40,707 --> 00:22:42,787
I have to contact Romdeau now.

2470
00:22:43,337 --> 00:22:44,547
Calm down.

2471
00:22:45,087 --> 00:22:45,957
Drink this.

2472
00:22:45,957 --> 00:22:46,837
Shut up!

2473
00:22:57,557 --> 00:22:58,927
What's going on?

2474
00:22:59,387 --> 00:23:00,977
Why is PROXY here?

2475
00:23:04,317 --> 00:23:05,477
Why?

2476
00:23:06,027 --> 00:23:08,937
Why does it only show up where you are?

2477
00:23:08,937 --> 00:23:10,237
Answer me!

2478
00:23:13,067 --> 00:23:14,407
What in the world...

2479
00:23:15,777 --> 00:23:16,737
are you?

2480
00:23:19,327 --> 00:23:20,457
Miss Re-l!

2481
00:23:24,747 --> 00:23:25,707
Like I said,

2482
00:23:25,707 --> 00:23:28,667
Timothy won't give the book back to me.

2483
00:23:28,667 --> 00:23:29,917
Right, right.

2484
00:23:29,917 --> 00:23:32,257
He won't even answer me.

2485
00:24:18,257 --> 00:24:29,317
Please

2486
00:24:18,257 --> 00:24:29,317
could

2487
00:24:18,257 --> 00:24:29,317
you

2488
00:24:18,257 --> 00:24:29,317
stop

2489
00:24:18,257 --> 00:24:29,317
the

